    "model": "Place the quadrats at random: lay two tape measures at right angles along two edges of the study area, generate pairs of random numbers (calculator or random-number tables) as coordinates, walk to each coordinate and place the quadrat there. Also take enough quadrats (at least 10 to 20) so the sample is representative.",
