    "model": "Cross: XNXN (person 7) x XnY. Gametes: XN, XN x Xn, Y. Offspring: XNXn (carrier daughters) and XNY (normal sons). All daughters are carriers, so the chance of a carrier daughter is 100% (equivalently 50% of all children).",
